<title>GERMANY: CASS Ex-Germany July Asia/Pacific cargo data.</title>
<headline>CASS Ex-Germany July Asia/Pacific cargo data.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table shows IATA Cargo Accounts Settlement System (CASS) statistics for the ex-Germany air cargo market in July 1996.</p>
<p>			  S.Asia	S.E.Asia    Japan/Korea</p>
<p>S.W.Pacific</p>
<p> Weight (kg)	  2,196,885   6,904,261   4,903,177 1,375,429</p>
<p> Kg change (6/96)	  1.4%	  1.2%	 -0.6% 0.9%</p>
<p> Kg change (7/95)	 -3.8%	 11.8%	  8.2% 3.0%</p>
<p> Dm change (6/96)	 -2.8%	  3.0%	 -0.7% -0.2%</p>
<p> Dm change (7/95)	 -6.3%	  4.7%	  6.8% -1.1%</p>
<p> Dm/Kg change (6/96)    -4.1%	  1.8%	 -0.1% -1.1%</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
